    "description": "# BA-8 (support): Deal Cross-Reference Formula Fields on Deal Rep Assignment\n\n_Surface the related Deal's Market, Vertical, and Status on the Deal Rep Assignment junction object, so they can be shown as columns on the Assigned Deals related list on Brand Ambassador._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Deal Market — Formula, references the related Deal's Market field\n* Deal Vertical — Formula, references the related Deal's Vertical field\n* Deal Status — Formula, references the related Deal's Status field\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Needed because related list column pickers only offer fields native to the child object\n\n* Market, Vertical, and Deal Status live on Deal, not on Deal Rep Assignment — confirmed while configuring [BUILD-209 — Brand Ambassador: Assigned Deals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693390189778/f/)'s related list columns. They will not appear as selectable columns until these formula fields exist on Deal Rep Assignment.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: none — this ticket was opened directly from a build blocker Taryn hit while working BUILD-209, not from a user-story doc.\n* Kobi Kunasekaran confirmed this formula-field approach directly (Slack, Aug 25, 2026) — not from a recorded transcript.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* No user-story doc citation — created directly from a build blocker on BUILD-209, confirmed with Kobi Kunasekaran via Slack, Aug 25, 2026.\n* Dependents: [BUILD-209 — Brand Ambassador: Assigned Deals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693390189778/f/) (blocked on this ticket's fields)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-25 directly from a BUILD-209 build blocker, confirmed with Kobi.\n\n",
